%% State machine of a brief (Brief.review.status).
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Draft : agents finish a run<br/>(brief.generated)
  Draft --> InReview : staff open it and<br/>review a statement
  InReview --> InReview : approve, edit or reject<br/>a statement (statement.reviewed)
  InReview --> Published : publish by a named reviewer<br/>(brief.published)
  Published --> Draft : staff regenerate after<br/>the report changes
  InReview --> Draft : staff regenerate
  Published --> [*] : decision made,<br/>brief kept as a record

  Draft : Draft
  Draft : shown as "Draft, not yet reviewed by staff"
  InReview : In review
  InReview : still labelled draft to residents
  Published : Published
  Published : "Approved by (name), (date)"
  note right of Published
    Publish needs a staff token and a reviewer name.
    Each change is a new log entry; the old ones stay.
  end note
